<title>UK: Invesco Plc Q3 pretax profit rises.</title>
<headline>Invesco Plc Q3 pretax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) diluted    4.1		    vs 3.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     16.5		   vs 11.7</p>
<p>NOTE: Basic earnings per share were 4.6p versus 3.3p.  </p>
<p> Operating profit	 16.2		   vs 11.3</p>
<p> Tax			  5.1		    vs 3.7</p>
<p> Net taxed		  11.4		   vs 8.0</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
